    "summary": "1 CP, in your Shooting phase or in a Fight phase of either turn. Choose one NECRONS unit of yours that has not yet been picked to shoot or to fight in this phase. Until the phase ends, whenever one of its models attacks, you may disregard some or all modifiers to that attack's Weapon Skill or Ballistic Skill and to its Hit roll. A CRYPTEK unit may also disregard some or all modifiers to its Wound roll.",
